{"build":"4b9ed06@15/11/2026, 10:40:41","data":{"book":{"title":"Gaudija Gītandžalī","subtitle":"Vaišnavu dziesmas un lūgšanas","slug":"lv","sort_order":5,"songsCount":91},"descriptions":[{"title":"Kirtan Guide","title_full_short":"Kīrtan Guide 12th Ed","subtitle":"London, Twelfth Edition, 2026","slug":"en","sort_order":1,"shortcuts":[{"icon":"clock","title":"The Daily Programme","slug":"003-programme"}],"audio":{"filter":{"by_title":["Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","Srila B.R. Sridhar Dev-Goswami Maharaj","Nabadwip temple","Kamal Krishna Prabhu","Manasa Krishna Prabhu"]}},"songsCount":194},{"title":"Гаудия Гитанджали","subtitle":"Cборник вайшнавских песен и молитв","slug":"ru","sort_order":2,"render":{"tg.contents.first_line":false,"tg.a-z.title.words":3},"songsCount":178},{"title":"Guía de Kīrtan","subtitle":"Edición Detallada. Con traducción palabra por palabra y explicación de estilo","slug":"es","sort_order":3,"songsCount":146},{"title":"Livro de Kirtan","subtitle":"Seva Ashram, Campos do Jordão","slug":"pt","language":"pt-BR","sort_order":4,"songsCount":112},{"title":"Gaudija Gītandžalī","subtitle":"Vaišnavu dziesmas un lūgšanas","slug":"lv","sort_order":5,"songsCount":91},{"title":"Ґаудія Ґітанджалі","subtitle":"Вайшнавський пісенник українскою мовою","slug":"ua","sort_order":6,"language":"uk","render":{"tg.contents.first_line":false,"tg.a-z.title.words":4},"songsCount":71},{"title":"Pocket Kirtan Guide","subtitle":"Nabadwip, 2013","slug":"en-pe","language":"en","sort_order":7,"songsCount":80},{"title":"Kirtan Guide","subtitle":"Chiang Mai English Edition, 2022","slug":"en-2022","sort_order":8,"hidden":true,"songsCount":166}],"nav":{"50":{"prev":{"path":"/lv/samsara-davanala-lidha-loka/","title":"Śrī Śrī Gurvāṣṭaka"},"next":{"path":"/lv/vibhavari-shiesha-aloka-praveshia/","title":"Vibhāvarī Śeṣa"}}},"song":{"meta":{"page":50,"first_line":"śrī-kṛṣṇa-chaitanya prabhu jīve dayā kori’"},"title":["Śaraṇāgati - labvēlīgs aicinājums"],"author":["Šrīla Bhaktivinoda Thākurs"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["śrī-kṛṣṇa-chaitanya prabhu jīve dayā kori’","svapārṣada svīya dhāma saha avatari"],"translation":["Kungs Šrī Krišna Čaitanja, žēlsirdīgs pret dvēselēm, kopā ar saviem pavadoņiem un mājvietu tu nolaidies šajā pasaulē."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["atyanta durlabha prema koribāre dāna","śikhāya saraṇāgati bhakatera prāṇa"],"translation":["Tu atnāci, lai dāsni dāvātu tik reto dievišķo mīlestību, sludinot nedalītu pašatdevi, bhaktu dzīves pašu būtību."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["dainya, ātmanivedana, goptṛtve varaṇa","‘avaśya rakṣibe kṛṣṇa’—viśvāsa pālana"],"translation":["Pazemība, pašatdeve, sevis atdošana Dieva gribai, “Krišna mani noteikti pasargās” – šādas ticības uzturēšana."],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["bhakti-anukūla mātra kārjera svīkāra","bhakti-pratikūla bhāva—varjanāṅgīkāra"],"translation":["Kalpošanai labvēlīgas darbības pieņemšana un nelabvēlīgas – noraidīšana."],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["ṣaḍ-aṅga śaraṇāgati hoibe jā̐hāra","tā̐hāra prārthanā śune śrī-nandakumāra"],"translation":["To lūgšanas, kuri sniedz sevi Dievam šajos sešos veidos, nešaubīgi tiks Nandas dēla sadzirdētas!"],"isLong":false},{"number":"6","text":["rūpa-sanātana-pade dante tṛṇa kori’","bhakativinoda poḍe dui pada dhori’"],"translation":["Saspiežot zobos zāles stiebriņu un krītot pie Šrī Rūpas un Šrī Sanātanas pēdām, Šrī Bhaktivinoda pazemīgi apskauj viņu svētās, lotosam līdzīgās pēdas."],"isLong":false},{"number":"7","text":["kā̐diyā kā̐diyā bole, āmi to’ adhama","śikhāye śaraṇāgati karahe uttama"],"translation":["Raudot, lejot asaras, es vēršos pie viņiem: “Es esmu pats kritušākais! Lūdzu, māciet man pašatdevi, māciet man tīru kalpošanu!”"],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Kamal Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/jayasri-sound/01-sri-krishna-chaitanya","personSlug":"kamal-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/sri-krishna-chaitanya-prabhu-1","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Śaraṇāgati---labvēlīgs-aicinājums-02-22"},"head":{"canonical":"/lv/shri-krishna-chaitanya-prabhu-jive-daya-kori/","description":"Śaraṇāgati - labvēlīgs aicinājums — vaišnavu dziesma ar vārdiem, tulkojumu latviešu valodā un skaidrojumu vārdu pa vārdam. Autors — Šrīla Bhaktivinoda Thākurs. No grāmatas «Gaudija Gītandžalī».","title":"Śaraṇāgati - labvēlīgs aicinājums. Šrīla Bhaktivinoda Thākurs | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"lv","slug":"shri-krishna-chaitanya-prabhu-jive-daya-kori"}}